@identity = http://localhost:8081

### Cadastro do comprador
POST {{identity}}/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana Silva",
  "cpf": "529.982.247-25",
  "email": "ana@revenda.com",
  "password": "Revenda2026"
}

### Login do comprador
# @name loginComprador
POST {{identity}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@revenda.com",
  "password": "Revenda2026"
}

### Login do administrador criado na subida
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{identity}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@revenda.com",
  "password": "Revenda2026"
}

### Perfil do comprador autenticado
GET {{identity}}/customers/me
Authorization: Bearer {{loginComprador.response.body.accessToken}}

### Atualizacao do proprio cadastro
PUT {{identity}}/customers/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginComprador.response.body.accessToken}}

{
  "name": "Ana Souza",
  "email": "ana.souza@revenda.com"
}

### Chave publica usada pelo servico de veiculos
GET {{identity}}/.well-known/jwks.json

### Saude
GET {{identity}}/health
